      en: ["The reinforced concrete wings have a total span of 30 meters.", "The building was not damaged during the independence war.", "It is located at the intersection of Sematat and Mereb streets.", "Giuseppe Pettazzi was a prominent representative of Italian futurism.", "Asmara was declared a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2017.", "The wingtips bend only minimally under load."],
